Instructors: Pavel Pevzner (20), Miles Jones (21), Gary Gillespie (30, 100), Daniele Micciancio (101), Miles Jones (105)? Original: CSE 105 sp24 "Professor Miles Jones"? Let me just reuse reasonable ones from my original file. Slugs were `ucsd-cse-20-wi24` format: `${universitySlug}-${code.toLowerCase().replace(/\s+/g,"-")}-${term}` → `ucsd-cse-20-wi24`.

Now the catalog.ts orchestrator:

```
